  "published": "2026-06-24T07:19:56.67Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Add DateTimeOffset overloads for every DateTime API (RelativeTime, BusinessDay, PositionalTime, DateTimeDiff, manipulation, and more)\n- Add DateOnly and TimeOnly extensions for relative time, calendar time, formatting, manipulation, and week/quarter helpers\n- Add Moment.Min, Moment.Max, and Moment.Range for DateTime, DateTimeOffset, and DateOnly\n- Add ReadOnlySpan Min/Max overloads on .NET 8+\n- Add IsDaylightSavingTime extensions and quarter/ISO-week APIs (StartOf/EndOf Quarter and IsoWeek, DiffInQuarters)\n- Multi-target net6.0, net8.0, and netstandard2.0; package icon and expanded README\n- Fix CalendarTime to format the source date (not the reference), DiffInMonths fractional day calculation, and week-boundary logic in StartOf/EndOf(Week)\n- Improve AddBusinessDays to O(1) for non-holiday overloads; DateTimeOffset methods preserve UTC offset with offset-aware comparisons",
